        "nobel_worthiness": "The theoretical prediction and experimental realization of the quantum spin Hall effect opened a major new direction in condensed matter physics and led to a broad, productive field of topological materials.",
        "attribution": "Kane and Mele established the theoretical framework; Molenkamp’s group provided an early decisive experimental realization. The proposed trio captures the theory-to-experiment arc, though the wider development involved additional contributors.",
