        "nobel_worthiness": "Single nitrogen-vacancy spins in diamond established a robust solid-state platform for quantum sensing and control, linking quantum physics to practical measurements.",
        "attribution": "Jelezko and Wrachtrup were central to experimental control of individual defect spins; Lukin helped develop the sensing framework and its broader significance.",
        "maturity": "The sensing demonstrations are reproducible and the platform is well established, though its ultimate practical reach continues to develop.",
        "uncertainties": [
